# Pixel Tablet (tangorpro): temporary workaround for meta-webos-ports#822.
# https://github.com/webOS-ports/meta-webos-ports/issues/822
#
# The vendor storage proxy triggers a Trusty secure-storage assertion after the
# first boot. 50-stub-services bind-mounts stub-sleep over this binary before
# Android init runs, covering its explicit restart and early_hal class starts.
# The vendor partition and existing secure-storage files stay unchanged.
#
# This disables Android-backed secure storage, including clients such as
# KeyMint/Gatekeeper/fingerprint. It does not repair the underlying mismatch.
# Remove this rule once the real storage fix is verified on tangorpro.
/vendor/bin/storageproxyd
